  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"'Enlightenment #1' is the first bookwork of the Enlightenment Series. The entire work was conceived, designed and handconstructed by the artist, Celia Alvarez Munoz. All materials are archival; cover is white Kidskin Lexoton, embossed white folder is Rives BFK, pages are white Lustro Cover with silver prints. Grey Davy Board, a large staple and black sandpaper join to comprise a large matchbook design. Text was printed offset in Century 18 pt"--Colophon.</subfield>
